	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Ex tuis (reverende pater) ne syllaba interiit.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Tuta et salva <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>sunt omnia.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Magna tua diligentia, curae, vigilantia, <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>pietas, humanitas nos quos alacriores, vigilantiores <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>et ad omnia promptiores reddit.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Error meus circa <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>comitiorum diem foedus est, fateor, et mihi ipsi non semel <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>irascor; sed ita fit, cum multa simul urgent, quę simul <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>tamen vix recte expediri queunt.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Sed quoniam peccatum <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>est, satius est in hanc potius quam alteram partem <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>peccasse; peccatum enim hoc corrigi potest.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">D. <persName ref="p629">Coignetius</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>scripsit quidem, sed adeo succincte, ut vix summam literarum <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>assequar, de eo, quod scire cupiebam, ne verbum quidem.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z12"/>Addit autem d. d. <persName ref="p8111">Martyrem</persName> a regina humanissime exceptum, <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>cum qua diu admodum colloquutus sit; bonam esse <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>spem; d. <persName ref="p8033">Bezam</persName> elegantem orationem habuisse coram <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>rege, principibus ac episcopis.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">16. septembris responsum <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>expectabatur (dicit enim: "Cras responsum dabitur", sunt autem literę <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>15. septembris scriptae).</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Pollicetur se de successu ad dominos nostros <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>perscripturum.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Si ad te nihil, mirum certe est, i<lb xml:id="p1z19"/>deoque in <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>meis de <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>eo eum erudio, quas ut ei per occasionem mittas, <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>te etiam atque etiam rogo.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Sed non opus est per postam mittere <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>nisi per occasionem.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Quodsi res feliciter in <placeName ref="l832">Gallia</placeName> succedit <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>et d. <persName ref="p629">Coignetius</persName> de eo, ut pollicetur, ad nostros perscribet <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>(quod ut faciat, eum in meis hortor), multum promovebit nostram <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>causam.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="de">Dan als yetz diser tagen die höupter in dem <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>Oberen Pundt ze tagen by einander versamlet und man diser <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>unserer sachen ze reden worden und ettliche hand wöllen <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>uff den ußtrag des concilij warten, hat <persName>Cabalzar</persName> <foreign xml:lang="la">(qui inter <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>priores est)</foreign> geantwortet: "Es wirt nit als vyl an dem <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>concilio als an <placeName ref="l832">Franckrych</placeName> gelegen syn; wir wöllend <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>warten, was uß <placeName ref="l832">Franckrych</placeName> kompt.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="de">Fält es daselbst, <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>so hat es dem bapst um ein grobs gefält."</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Haec per <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>d. consulem, cui quis, qui interfuit, secreto.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Ita etiam papistę, <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>qui sunt <persName>Gallicę</persName> factionis, sua vela secundum <placeName ref="l832">Gallię</placeName> ventum <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>dirigunt<note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1">Zur Redensart vgl. <bibl source="b260">Grimm</bibl> X/I 85.</note>.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">Consultissimum ergo erit, ut tu quoque faustissim<lb xml:id="p1z37"/>a quaeque consignari cures et ad nos transmitti.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z38"/>In his omnibus tandem ad unum deum confugio; nam, <lb xml:id="p1z39"/>quod tu scribis, proh dolor, nimium verum est.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z40"/>Cęter<pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>a Germanica remitto et gratias ingentes habeo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la">Legimus fratribus in <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>synodo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z3"/>Episcopus quoque legit et d. <persName>de Rozins</persName>, sed non <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>tanquam me sciente; per alios enim haec illis exhibita tanquam me clam <lb xml:id="p2z6"/>et ignorante.</s>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la">Episcopus inter legendum se multum torsit etc.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell"><lb xml:id="p2z7"/>Vale, reverende in Christo pater.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l98">Curię</placeName> eodem die quo <lb xml:id="p2z8"/>cętera.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la">Reliqua <placeName ref="l822">Germanica</placeName> proxime mittam.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="la">Si quę nova e<lb xml:id="p2z9"/>x nundinis habentur et tibi non vacat exscribere, da affini <lb xml:id="p2z10"/>meo, qui scribat, et nobiscum communica etc.</s>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z11"/>Marium nondum vidi.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="29" xml:lang="la"><persName>Christianus</persName> ille, qui superioribus annis a <lb xml:id="p2z12"/>vobis commendabatur, qui coniugem deseruit, male se gerit, <lb xml:id="p2z13"/>insuper et temulentus est, et periculum est, ne ad vomitum, <lb xml:id="p2z14"/>id est papißmum, redeat<note xml:id="fn2" type="footnote" n="2">Vgl. <cit type="bible"><ref>Spr 26, 11</ref></cit>; <cit type="bible"><ref>2Petr 2, 22</ref></cit>.</note>.</s>
					<s n="30" xml:lang="la">Actum est cum illo, <lb xml:id="p2z15"/>u<lb xml:id="p2z16"/>t coniugem intra 3 septimanas <lb xml:id="p2z17"/>recipiat aut loco ced<lb xml:id="p2z18"/>at.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="31" xml:lang="la">Tui observantissimus<note type="misc">..servandiß!</note></s>
					<s n="32" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p8009">Iohannes Fabricius</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse fehlt.]</note>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
